  "interpretation": [
    "The existing scores already supply exported-trajectory union coverage; do not rerun a native evaluator merely to obtain that same union.",
    "Within this exported evidence, unavailable reference span coverage is much larger than the final-selection coverage loss: union coverage itself is only 2.67%,32.60%,32.74%. This identifies a low coverage ceiling of the exported evidence.",
